#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:12
msgid ""
"Multi-tenancy is an Enterprise-only feature. Essentials and Advanced "
"deployments operate as a single tenant."
msgstr ""
"Multi-tenancy es un Enterprise-solo característica. Essentials y Advanced "
"deployments operate as a single inquilino."

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:14
msgid ""
"A Tenant in |morpheus| is an isolated environment with unique users and "
"workloads. The Master Tenant is the default Tenant in |morpheus|, created "
"upon installation. All other Tenants outside of the Master Tenants are "
"Subtenants."
msgstr ""
"Un Inquilino en |morpheus| es un aislado entorno con único usuarios y cargas"
" de trabajo. El Inquilino maestro es el predeterminado Inquilino en "
"|morpheus|, creado upon instalación. Todos otro Inquilinos outside de el "
"Inquilino maestros son Subinquilinos."

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:18
msgid ""
"The Master Tenant is the default Tenant created during the installation of "
"|morpheus|"
msgstr ""
"El Inquilino maestro es el predeterminado Inquilino creado durante el "
"instalación de |morpheus|"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:19
msgid ""
"All Tenants created after installation are Subtenants. Only one Master "
"Tenant can exist"
msgstr ""
"Todos Inquilinos creado después de instalación son Subinquilinos. Solo uno "
"Inquilino maestro puede existir"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:20
msgid "The Master Tenant creates and controls all Subtenants."
msgstr "El Inquilino maestro crea y controla todos Subinquilinos."

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:21
msgid ""
"Tenants are isolated environments with unique users, workloads, and Groups"
msgstr ""
"Inquilinos son aislado entornos con único usuarios, cargas de trabajo, y "
"Grupos"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:22
msgid "The Master Tenant can share or assign its resources to Subtenants"
msgstr "El Inquilino maestro puede share o assign su recursos a Subinquilinos"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:23
msgid "Subtenants cannot share their resources with other Tenants"
msgstr "Subinquilinos cannot share su recursos con otro Inquilinos"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:24
msgid "Subtenants cannot see resources from other Subtenants"
msgstr "Subinquilinos cannot see recursos desde otro Subinquilinos"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:25
msgid ""
"Subtenants can only access Master Tenant resources that have been set to "
"Public visibility or specifically assigned to the Subtenant"
msgstr ""
"Subinquilinos puede solo acceso Inquilino maestro recursos ese han sido "
"establecido a Público visibilidad o specifically asignado a el Subinquilino"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:111
#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:30
msgid "Roles"
msgstr "Roles"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:32
msgid ""
"There are two Role types in |morpheus|, Tenant Roles and User Roles. "
"Understanding these Role types is key to effectively administering Role "
"permissions in |morpheus|. These two Role types are discussed in greater "
"detail in this section."
msgstr ""
"There son two Rol tipos en |morpheus|, Roles de Inquilino y Roles de "
"Usuario. Understanding estos Rol tipos es key a effectively administering "
"Rol permisos en |morpheus|. Estos two Rol tipos son discussed en greater "
"detalle en este sección."

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:35
msgid "Tenant Roles"
msgstr "Roles de Inquilino"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:37
msgid ""
"Tenant Roles set the maximum permission levels for Users in the Tenant. User"
" Role permissions will not exceed the permissions of the Tenant Role."
msgstr ""
"Roles de Inquilino establecido el maximum permiso niveles para Usuarios en "
"el Inquilino. Rol de Usuario permisos no exceed el permisos de el Rol de "
"Inquilino."

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:39
msgid "Tenant Roles set the maximum permissions for a Tenant"
msgstr "Roles de Inquilino establecido el maximum permisos para a Inquilino"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:40
msgid ""
"User Roles in a Tenant cannot exceed the permissions of the Tenant Role"
msgstr ""
"Roles de Usuario en a Inquilino cannot exceed el permisos de el Rol de "
"Inquilino"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:41
msgid "A Tenant Role can be assigned to one or multiple Tenants"
msgstr "Un Rol de Inquilino puede ser asignado a uno o múltiples Inquilinos"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:42
msgid ""
"Tenant Roles determine Cloud access for the Subtenant such that all Clouds "
"in the Master Tenant which have visibility set to Public will show as "
"options in the Tenant Role Cloud Access tab"
msgstr ""
"Roles de Inquilino determine Nube acceso para el Subinquilino such ese todos"
" Nubes en el Inquilino maestro que tienen visibilidad establecido a Público "
"va a show as opciones en el Rol de Inquilino Nube Acceso pestaña"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:43
msgid ""
"Only Master Tenant Clouds given access in the Tenant Role will be accessible"
" in the Subtenant"
msgstr ""
"Solo Inquilino maestro Nubes given acceso en el Rol de Inquilino será "
"accessible en el Subinquilino"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:45
msgid ""
"Tenant Roles cap permissions on all Subtenant User Roles. User Roles can be "
"created in the Subtenant with lesser permissions than the Tenant Role "
"allows. Tenant Roles are designed for a Master Tenant Admin to set max "
"permissions for the Subtenant, and a Subtenant Admin to configure User Roles"
" inside the Subtenant."
msgstr ""
"Roles de Inquilino cap permisos en todos Subinquilino Roles de Usuario. "
"Roles de Usuario puede ser creado en el Subinquilino con lesser permisos "
"than el Rol de Inquilino permite. Roles de Inquilino son designed para a "
"Inquilino maestro Admin a establecido max permisos para el Subinquilino, y a"
" Subinquilino Admin a configure Roles de Usuario inside el Subinquilino."

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:48
msgid "User Roles"
msgstr "Roles de Usuario"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:50
msgid ""
"User Roles determine feature, Group, and Instance Type access for all Users."
" In a multi-Tenant environment, there are two types of User Roles: Single-"
"Tenant User Roles and Multi-Tenant User Roles."
msgstr ""
"Roles de Usuario determine característica, Grupo, y Tipo de Instancia acceso"
" para todos Usuarios. En a multi-Inquilino entorno, there son two tipos de "
"Roles de Usuario: Single-Inquilino Roles de Usuario y Multi-Inquilino Roles "
"de Usuario."

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Single-Tenant User Roles:** These exist solely in the Tenant they are "
"created in. All Roles created in a Subtenant will be Single-Tenant User "
"Roles"
msgstr ""
"**Single-Tenant User Roles:** Estos existir solely en el Inquilino ellos son"
" creado en. Todos Roles creado en a Subinquilino será Single-Inquilino Roles"
" de Usuario"

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Multi-Tenant User Roles:** The Master Tenant can create Multi-Tenant User "
"Roles. These Roles are automatically seeded into Subtenants and can be "
"assigned to Subtenant Users. Changes to Multi-Tenant User Roles made in the "
"Master Tenant are propagated to all Subtenants. However, once a Multi-Tenant"
" User Role is edited inside a Subtenant, it is no longer linked to the "
"Multi-Tenant User Role and becomes its own unique Role. It will no longer "
"receive propagated changes."
msgstr ""
"**Multi-Tenant User Roles:** El Inquilino maestro puede crear Multi-"
"Inquilino Roles de Usuario. Estos Roles son automáticamente seeded en "
"Subinquilinos y puede ser asignado a Subinquilino Usuarios. Changes a Multi-"
"Inquilino Roles de Usuario made en el Inquilino maestro son propagated a "
"todos Subinquilinos. Sin embargo, once a Multi-Inquilino Rol de Usuario es "
"edited inside a Subinquilino, ello es no longer linked a el Multi-Inquilino "
"Rol de Usuario y becomes su own único Rol. It va a no longer receive "
"propagated changes."

#: ../../administration/tenants/tenants.rst:55
msgid ""
"Multi-Tenant User Roles are intended to make Subtenant User Role creation "
"easier, so Master Tenant Users do not have to re-create the same base "
"Subtenant Users Roles for every Subtenant. Multi-Tenant User Roles are not a"
" single Role across Tenants, but more like a template that creates new "
"Subtenant User Roles that can then be managed in the Sub Tenant."
msgstr ""
"Multi-Inquilino Roles de Usuario son intended a make Subinquilino Rol de "
"Usuario creation easier, so Inquilino maestro Usuarios hacer no tienen a re-"
"crear el mismo base Subinquilino Usuarios Roles para every Subinquilino. "
"Multi-Inquilino Roles de Usuario son no a single Rol a través de Inquilinos,"
" pero más like a template ese crea nuevo Subinquilino Roles de Usuario ese "
"puede then be gestionado en el Sub Inquilino."

