#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:2
msgid "Configuring Tenants and Resources for Multi-Tenancy"
msgstr "Configuring Inquilinos y Recursos para Multi-Tenancy"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:4
msgid ""
"A very common scenario for Managed Service Providers is the need to provide "
"access to resources on a customer by customer basis. Several administrative "
"features are available in |morpheus| to ensure customer resources are "
"properly scoped and isolated. With its built multi-tenancy capabilities and "
"white label support, managed service providers have a wide range of "
"capabilities when it comes to managing customer Tenants and users."
msgstr ""
"Un very common scenario para Gestionado Service Providers es el need a "
"provide acceso a recursos en a customer por customer basis. Several "
"administrative características están disponibles en |morpheus| a asegurar "
"customer recursos son properly scoped y aislado. Con su built multi-tenancy "
"capabilities y white label soporte, gestionado service providers tienen a "
"wide range de capabilities cuando ello comes a managing customer Inquilinos "
"y usuarios."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:9
msgid "There are essentially two types of Tenants in |morpheus|"
msgstr "There son essentially two tipos de Inquilinos en |morpheus|"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:11
msgid "Master Tenant"
msgstr "Inquilino maestro"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:12
msgid "Sub Tenants"
msgstr "Sub Inquilinos"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:14
msgid ""
"During the initial setup of a |morpheus| Appliance, the Master Tenant is "
"created. All Tenants created in addition to this Master Tenant are sub-"
"Tenants. There can only be one Master Tenant, and sub-Tenants cannot become "
"the Master Tenant. The delineation between the Master Tenant and sub-Tenants"
" is important to understand for properly scoping resources across Tenants."
msgstr ""
"Durante el initial setup de a |morpheus| Appliance, el Inquilino maestro es "
"creado. Todos Inquilinos creado además de este Inquilino maestro son sub-"
"Inquilinos. There puede solo be uno Inquilino maestro, y sub-Inquilinos no "
"puede sercome el Inquilino maestro. El delineation entre el Inquilino "
"maestro y sub-Inquilinos es important a understand para properly scoping "
"recursos a través de Inquilinos."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:17
msgid "Creating Tenants"
msgstr "Creando Inquilinos"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:19
msgid ""
"The Master Tenant is created during the initial appliance setup. Additional "
"sub-Tenants can be created in the |AdmTen| section."
msgstr ""
"El Inquilino maestro es creado durante el initial appliance setup. "
