#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:127
msgid ""
"When a cloud is set to Public visibility, it is available to be added to "
"Subtenants. All Subtenants created after a Master Tenant cloud is set to "
"public will automatically have clouds with public visibility added, and a "
"group will be created for each available cloud matching the cloud name in "
"the new Subtenant(s)."
msgstr ""
"Cuando a cloud se establece en Público visibilidad, ello está disponible a "
"be agregado a Subinquilinos. Todos Subinquilinos creado después de a "
"Inquilino maestro cloud se establece en público va a automáticamente tienen "
"nubes con público visibilidad agregado, y a grupo será creado para cada "
"disponible cloud matching el cloud nombre en el nuevo Subinquilino(s)."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:129
msgid ""
"For Tenants created prior to a Master Tenant cloud being set to public "
"visibility, the Subtenant will have the option to add that cloud but it will"
" not automatically be added."
msgstr ""
"Para Inquilinos creado prior a a Inquilino maestro cloud being establecido a"
" público visibilidad, el Subinquilino va a tienen el opción a agregar ese "
"cloud pero ello no automáticamente be agregado."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:131
msgid ""
"While the cloud will be available for Subtenants, the resources available in"
" that cloud to the Subtenant(s) depends on the visibility or assignment of "
"the individual resources."
msgstr ""
"While el cloud será disponible para Subinquilinos, el recursos disponible en"
" ese cloud a el Subinquilino(s) depends en el visibilidad o assignment de el"
" individual recursos."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:133
msgid ""
"A Subtenant user must have sufficient role permissions and cloud access to "
"add publicly available clouds. Master Tenant clouds settings cannot be "
"edited from Subtenants."
msgstr ""
"Un Subinquilino usuario debe tienen sufficient rol permisos y cloud acceso a"
" agregar publicly disponible nubes. Inquilino maestro nubes configuración no"
" puede ser edited desde Subinquilinos."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:136
msgid "Assign a Cloud to an Tenant"
msgstr "Assign a Nube a un Inquilino"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:138
msgid ""
"When assigning a Cloud to a Tenant, all resources for that Cloud will only "
"be available to the assigned Tenant. If a cloud is created in the Master "
"Tenant and assigned to a sub-Tenant, it will no longer be available for use "
"by the Master Tenant or any other sub-Tenants, although it can be assigned "
"back to the Master Tenant, or to another sub-Tenant."
msgstr ""
"Cuando assigning a Nube a a Inquilino, todos recursos para ese Nube va a "
"solo be disponible a el asignado Inquilino. Si a cloud es creado en el "
"Inquilino maestro y asignado a a sub-Inquilino, ello va a no longer be "
"disponible para usar por el Inquilino maestro o cualquier otro sub-"
"Inquilinos, although ello puede ser asignado back a el Inquilino maestro, o "
"a another sub-Inquilino."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:140
msgid ""
"It may be preferable for service providers to share or assign their cloud "
"resources, such as specific hosts, networks, resources pools and datastores,"
" across sub-Tenants, rather than an entire cloud."
msgstr ""
"It puede be preferable para service providers a share o assign su cloud "
"recursos, como específico hosts, redes, recursos pools y datastores, a "
"través de sub-Inquilinos, rather than un completo cloud."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:142
msgid "**To assign a cloud from the Master Tenant to a Sub-Tenant**"
msgstr "**To assign a cloud from the Master Tenant to a Sub-Tenant**"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:144
msgid "Navigate to Infrastructure, Clouds"
msgstr "Navegue a Infraestructura, Nubes"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:146
msgid ""
"From the \"Tenant\" drop down, select the Tenant to assign the cloud to. The"
" visibility will automatically be set to \"Private\" when a cloud is "
"assigned to a sub-Tenant."
msgstr ""
"Desde el \"Inquilino\" drop down, seleccione el Inquilino a assign el cloud "
"a. El visibilidad va a automáticamente be establecido a \"Private\" cuando a"
" cloud es asignado a a sub-Inquilino."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:150
msgid ".. image:: images/advanced/configuring_multi_tenancy-c907d.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/advanced/configuring_multi_tenancy-c907d.png"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:151
msgid ""
"When a cloud is assigned to a sub-Tenant, or assigned to the Master Tenant "
"with private visibility, that cloud and all of its resources are only "
"available to the assigned Tenant. The Master Tenant still maintains control "
"and visibility, and can edit the cloud settings or re-assign the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Cuando a cloud es asignado a a sub-Inquilino, o asignado a el Inquilino "
"maestro con private visibilidad, ese cloud y todos de su recursos son solo "
"disponible a el asignado Inquilino. El Inquilino maestro still maintains "
"control y visibilidad, y puede editar el cloud configuración o re-assign el "
"cloud."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:154
msgid "Individual Resource Visibility & Assignment"
msgstr "Individual Recurso Visibilidad & Assignment"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:156
msgid ""
"Similar to clouds, individual resources from the Master Tenant can be set to"
" public and available to sub-Tenants, or assigned to sub-Tenants."
msgstr ""
"Similar a nubes, individual recursos desde el Inquilino maestro se puede "
"establecer a público y disponible a sub-Inquilinos, o asignado a sub-"
"Inquilinos."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:158
msgid ""
"By default, any host, virtual machine, bare metal server, network, resource "
"pool, datastore or blueprint added, created or inventoried by an Tenant is "
"assigned to that Tenant. If these resources are in the Master Tenant, they "
"can be assigned to sub Tenants. Assigning one of these resources will make "
"it unavailable to the Master Tenant, but it will still be visible and "
"editable by the Master Tenant. This allows Master Tenant resources to be "
"isolated for use by sub-Tenants while still under the control of the Master "
"Tenant."
msgstr ""
"De forma predeterminada, cualquier host, virtual machine, bare metal "
"servidor, red, recurso pool, datastore o blueprint agregado, creado o "
"inventoried por un Inquilino es asignado a ese Inquilino. Si estos recursos "
"son en el Inquilino maestro, ellos puede ser asignado a sub Inquilinos. "
"Assigning uno de estos recursos va a make ello unavailable a el Inquilino "
"maestro, pero ello va a still be visible y editable por el Inquilino "
"maestro. Este permite Inquilino maestro recursos a be aislado para usar por "
"sub-Inquilinos while still under el control de el Inquilino maestro."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:160
msgid ""
"Resources assigned to sub-Tenants from the Master Tenant will be visible and"
" available for use by that sub-Tenant, however they cannot be edited or re-"
"assigned by the sub-tenant."
msgstr ""
"Recursos asignado a sub-Inquilinos desde el Inquilino maestro será visible y"
" disponible para usar por ese sub-Inquilino, however ellos no puede ser "
"edited o re-asignado por el sub-inquilino."

