#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:220
msgid "**Set the Visibility or assign a Virtual Image to an Tenant**"
msgstr "**Set the Visibilidad or assign a Virtual Image to un Tenant**"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:222
msgid "From the Master Tenant, navigate to Provisioning, Virtual Images"
msgstr ""
"Desde el Inquilino maestro, navegue a Aprovisionamiento, Virtual Images"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:223
msgid "Select Edit from the \"Actions\" dropdown in the Virtual Images row"
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar Editar desde el \"Actions\" menú desplegable en el Virtual "
"Images row"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:224
msgid ""
"From the \"Visibility\" drop down, select either \"Public\" or \"Private\". "
"Public will share the"
msgstr ""
"Desde el \"Visibilidad\" drop down, seleccionar either \"Público\" o "
"\"Private\". Público va a share el"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:225
msgid ""
"From the \"Tenant\" field, start typing the name of the Tenant to assign the"
" Virtual Image to. Matching Tenants will populate, then select the Tenant to"
" add."
msgstr ""
"Desde el \"Inquilino\" campo, start typing el nombre de el Inquilino a "
"assign el Virtual Image a. Matching Inquilinos va a populate, then "
"seleccione el Inquilino a agregar."

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:227
msgid ""
"Virtual Images can be set to Private, but accessible to more that one Tenant"
msgstr ""
"Virtual Images se puede establecer a Private, pero accessible a más ese uno "
"Inquilino"

#: ../../administration/tenants/configuring_multi_tenancy.rst:229
msgid ""
"#. Repeat step 4 for all Tenants requiring access to the virtual image. .. "
"To remove access for an Tenant, click the \"x\" next to the Tenant name #. "
"Select :guilabel:`Save Changes` in the modal"
msgstr ""
"#. Repeat step 4 para todos Inquilinos requiring acceso a el virtual image. "
".. Un remove acceso para un Inquilino, haga clic en el \"x\" next a el "
"Inquilino nombre #. Seleccionar :guilabel:`Save Changes` en el modal"

